No Volume Mount
---
We can convert the design to not use a volume mount by making the STDOUT the piped audio file.

We can download the RSS and use it for testing etc by allowing it to be provided on STDIN.

Lastly, we can move the seq logic from inside the docker image to outside in the podcast script.

